                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7951c369-b74a-445f-8c66-3430bd7da686",
                        "source_entry_id": "414ee220-ba01-3173-be6b-54a443a1728b",
                        "source_sense_id": "065e6f45-eb58-3887-b6fe-50a3ae57ea7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Madonna",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madonna",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "165effa2-ff8b-3d66-bc39-f9ec9efc59c1",
                                        "entry_id": "e4b08806-fbdb-31be-8c13-ca40d481b331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of Mary, mother of Jesus, especially in Catholic contexts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "sometimes",
                                            "with-definite-article"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cb204ab-5122-3f16-a266-b3ec30c62ce1",
                                        "entry_id": "e4b08806-fbdb-31be-8c13-ca40d481b331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Italian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ad2798a-9545-4bd3-8ecb-d35601ef37bd",
                                                "sense_id": "1cb204ab-5122-3f16-a266-b3ec30c62ce1",
                                                "text": "We feel bound to add, however, that it is not very likely, in the usual chances of events, that such names as Alaric Attila Watts should have met in matrimony with those of Zillah Madonna Wiffen; and an unkind world may suggest a mystification somewhere."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e018c5b4-2b22-4abb-a4c2-8ad6a984a038",
                                                "sense_id": "1cb204ab-5122-3f16-a266-b3ec30c62ce1",
                                                "text": "But celebrities actually have a weak effect on baby names. As of 2000, the pop star Madonna had sold 130 million records worldwide but hadn't generated even the ten copycat namings―in California, no less―required to make the master index of four thousand names from which the sprawling list of girls' names on page 227 was drawn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa94f49e-8056-4e62-9a2e-d5252beda65a",
                                                "sense_id": "1cb204ab-5122-3f16-a266-b3ec30c62ce1",
                                                "text": "MADONNA(S) Yes. (They look at each other with surprise. The room goes silent.) MR. STEIN Two Madonnas? (Pause.) MR. STEIN Did either of you know God? EIGHTIES MADONNA I knew of Him. BIBLICAL MADONNA We had a Son together. MR. STEIN […] I’m going to have to ask you to leave. (The eighties Madonna gets up with a smile and then without uttering another word flounces out of the room loudly humming the tune ‘Like a Virgin’.)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madonna",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c8b564c-d978-3371-b17a-9857951786fd",
                                        "entry_id": "71b98fe5-5849-3d25-9f03-2bac44e36038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An artistic representation of the Virgin Mary, chiefly when holding the infant Jesus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "490e9cb5-bf74-4411-9494-16d1fcda18f3",
                                                "sense_id": "6c8b564c-d978-3371-b17a-9857951786fd",
                                                "text": "A beautiful example of this type of Madonna is the polyptych in the Museo Civico in Sansepolcro."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e1c990c-c7ee-40d3-a989-b8cfe22c0d56",
                                                "sense_id": "6c8b564c-d978-3371-b17a-9857951786fd",
                                                "text": "So many Madonnas were produced during the Renaissance that it became the habit to distinguish them by any peculiarity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                        "entry_id": "71b98fe5-5849-3d25-9f03-2bac44e36038",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A morally pure woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a638234-5be4-4be2-b869-5583169500dd",
                                                "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                                "text": "“Men,” I said, with a tone of disgust. “Halal circles, haram circles, good, bad, Madonnas, whores, goats, penises, it’s all the same.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a314e798-0183-4db8-a9b3-9b567954eb60",
                                                "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                                "text": "[…] the mothers who, like Sebastian’s mother in Notorious or Mitch’s mother Lydia in The Birds, block such a transference, or by potential love-objects who are, themselves, Madonnas, whores, or otherwise thinly disguised maternal figures."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21fc4f14-8647-4835-a10c-cbcb033fc7c0",
                                                "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                                "text": "The Madonnas are the mothers to our children, the pillars of our families, and the goddesses of our communities. The Madonnas shun the dark side of human sexuality and banish the whores to hell. We put the Madonnas on a pedestal, and we can’t think of them as being sexual or sexy because they must be pure. They must be virginal like the Madonna herself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3db1a74b-51d5-4268-85d3-9c7407ce675e",
                                                "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                                "text": "Sparing no one in her response to her interviewer’s questions about the ERA, she alludes to divisions within the women’s movement, referring to the factions as “Madonnas, whores, housewives, and lesbians.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdea761f-381e-42f1-9226-75cdcb224646",
                                                "sense_id": "bfea2f52-befe-399b-9e05-24bca916fdbe",
                                                "text": "In sexual politics the view of women as either Madonnas or whores limits women’s sexual expression, offering two mutually exclusive ways to construct a sexual identity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7a40414e-d756-4df9-af7e-c6246bf224e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "414ee220-ba01-3173-be6b-54a443a1728b",
                        "source_sense_id": "065e6f45-eb58-3887-b6fe-50a3ae57ea7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Madone",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madone",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "050f2bb1-0651-39ef-a800-2970617ba7b3",
                                        "entry_id": "bad2a171-1407-387c-903c-e35dde11207b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Commune d’Italie de la province de Bergame dans la région de la Lombardie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madone",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40a5f4c0-6f8d-363b-b5ec-1b9becd16449",
                                        "entry_id": "a49dc6d8-7754-31ca-907d-248513b5f0df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sainte Vierge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0465ee-356b-461f-ad64-32ec0e630a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "40a5f4c0-6f8d-363b-b5ec-1b9becd16449",
                                                "text": "Sainte Madone ! jurait l’Italien, c’est une somme ce que tou dis là, et vraiment tou crois qu’il a cet argent dans son portefeuille ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ec9268b-f7b9-4b41-81cb-6d672d384c9c",
                                                "sense_id": "40a5f4c0-6f8d-363b-b5ec-1b9becd16449",
                                                "text": "« Madone, dit-il en se relevant, faites que les gens d’ici soient morts ! »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madone",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d1f7ca1-6aaa-39a4-a8cf-92935c960cdc",
                                        "entry_id": "95d8a7e3-4a5a-3031-b969-c5bb7627b1b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Représentation de la vierge Marie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5c0a032-dad2-4f1d-b183-ef228c39a188",
                                                "sense_id": "6d1f7ca1-6aaa-39a4-a8cf-92935c960cdc",
                                                "text": "Tout y était : […] ; des Madones considérant d’un œil béat, leurs pieds et écartant des mains d’où partaient en lames d’éventail, des rayons jaunes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6704b72c-abb7-4b6e-866e-c3ef62ca0aad",
                                                "sense_id": "6d1f7ca1-6aaa-39a4-a8cf-92935c960cdc",
                                                "text": "J’étais un grand bateau descendant la Garonne\nFarci de contrebande et bourré d’Espagnols\nLes gens qui regardaient saluaient la Madone\nQue j’avais attachée en poupe par le col."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2f7a7986-45c2-4bbf-b4f2-643830fec59d",
                        "source_entry_id": "414ee220-ba01-3173-be6b-54a443a1728b",
                        "source_sense_id": "065e6f45-eb58-3887-b6fe-50a3ae57ea7c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Madonna",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Madonna",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04268ec3-a4d5-305e-9560-1be2a9dcfa78",
                                        "entry_id": "9ca4df32-853e-3fdd-82d9-5ca5c5498020",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anrede der Mutter Gottes"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Dichtung"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed7ac5bf-07c3-4719-8e5e-b75350aab12c",
                                                "sense_id": "04268ec3-a4d5-305e-9560-1be2a9dcfa78",
                                                "text": "„Nicht, wer die Menschheit, wer die Partei oder sonst eine Abstraktion, nicht, wer allein die Madonna oder ein anderes Numinosum liebt, ist kultiviert, sondern wer erst einmal einen Menschen lieben kann, durch alle Spannungen ambivalenter Erlebnisse hindurch, die er mit ihm haben wird.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b492e2ee-33d0-4691-87fc-5061f8767afd",
                                                "sense_id": "04268ec3-a4d5-305e-9560-1be2a9dcfa78",
                                                "text": "„Sie trugen die Madonna von Regiment zu Regiment, begleitet von Gesängen und Gebeten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce3ca18f-0d51-3593-b967-2bd4847376b3",
                                        "entry_id": "9ca4df32-853e-3fdd-82d9-5ca5c5498020",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Darstellung der Gottesmutter in der Kunst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Bildende Kunst",
                                            "Katholische Kirche"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3738c38-243f-4eab-9166-48908d1078bd",
                                                "sense_id": "ce3ca18f-0d51-3593-b967-2bd4847376b3",
                                                "text": "„Die Gruppe wird vervollständigt durch weitere Philosophen wie den halbnackten Diogenes, Archimedes mit den Kreisen, Pythagoras mit einer Harmonietabelle, Heraklit beim Abfassen von Rätseln, und unter den lauschenden Schülern ist einer, der Raffaels Züge trägt. Raffaels eigenes Werk aber zeigt diese Versöhnung da am deutlichsten, wo er in seinen zahlreichen Madonnen antike Anmut mit christlicher Frömmigkeit vereint. Die Lieblichkeit seiner Marienbilder wird von niemandem übertroffen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
